            "review_title": "Review at Quan Nguyet",
            "review_text": "Lookingforthegood\nGreater London, United Kingdom526 contributions\n0\nThings have changed here.\nFeb 2020\nThe man in charge nicked some small change off me when I first visited, and next time appeared to be in a temper slamming chairs around.\nThe beer is cheap, but no cheaper than other places on this street.\nThe food appeared to be expensive for the decor of this place.\nThe woman, seems tired of tourists, and is miserable and surly.\nI'm saying the king has no clothes on.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 24, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
