            "review_title": "Review at Quan Nguyet",
            "review_text": "None of Your Biz\nCanada764 contributions\n0\n4.5/5 A very pleasant surprise in a side street of Bui Vien\nMay 2019 • Solo\nI have walked by this place many times but has just assumed that it was just another overpriced restaurant for tourists who are happy with mediocre food.\n\nI was wrong! The food here is very well priced as well as delicious and authentically Vietnamese. They were out of eel for the day so I wasn't getting Curry Eel but the owner suggested Curry Frog instead .... and I'm glad that I agreed ;-)\n\nNeedless to say I went back the next day..... and this time they weren't out of Eel, so I got to eat the Curry Eel as well..... GREAT food at a GREAT price.\n\nIt's nice to see that in an environment where tourists happily pay for crap, this place still tries to do its best !\n\nCam on nhieu\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
