            "review_title": "Review at Quan Nguyet",
            "review_text": "VietHungryBoy\nBowral, Australia113 contributions\n1\nThe more things change the more it stays the same\nJul 2016 • Friends\nI first stumble on this bar in 2001 and every time I am in HCM I visit it. I am treated like an old friend. The bar has just outdoor seating and simple but beautiful home cooked style food. If there isn't any food on the menu you want which I would find surprising, there is a great noodle shop (Hu Tieu) across the road which you can order or the staff can and it isbrought over to you. It was originally a bia Hoi but this has fallen out of favour so beer is from bottles now and there are plenty of choices. Do yourself a favour if you are near take a seat enjoy the beer and watch the local go about the lives. It is great place for people watching.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 25, 2016",
